Right, I'd probably have it if they called me. Mates are going on about it online, but I'm not bothered either way, so I'd just get on with it.

I'd take it when it's offered, I don't think I'd rush down anywhere for it. If it were at the chemist on my way round, I'd get it when I had a spare half hour, which isn't often. If my missus or mates were thinking about it, I'd tell them to get on with it, though I wouldn't go on at them. Whether it's really important? I don't know. Lot of talk about it, and the way they've handled everything, I'm not sure what to make of it.

